---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import overviewImage from "../assets/overview.png"; // Image is 1600x900
---

<Layout title="Goodbye for now.">
	<main>
  <div class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none">
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Seven years of innovation comes to an end.</h1>
        <div class="mt-10 grid max-w-xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-base leading-7 text-gray-700 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <p><span class="font-bold">MONTEM A/S</span> was a company founded with a vision of creating innovative solutions for SmartCity technologies. Over the last seven years, we have been dedicated to building cutting-edge solutions that make cities more connected, efficient, and sustainable. Our flagship products, CityFlow and CityProbe 2, have been well-received by customers and partners alike. However, it is with a heavy heart that we must announce that MONTEM is shutting down.</p>
            <p class="mt-10">As a company, we have always been committed to driving innovation in the SmartCity space. Our CityFlow solution was designed to be a comprehensive platform that helps city officials manage everything from transportation to public safety. Our CityProbe 2 was designed to collect and transmit data about various aspects of city life, from air quality to traffic flow. Both of these products were designed to help cities become more livable, sustainable, and connected.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>Despite our best efforts, however, we have decided to voluntarily shut down MONTEM. While our CityFlow solution and CityProbe 2 have received positive feedback from customers and partners, we have come to the conclusion that we need to pursue innovation in a different way to gain more traction.</p>
            <p class="mt-4">We believe that by shutting down MONTEM, we will be able to pursue new opportunities that will allow us to drive innovation more effectively. While it is difficult to say goodbye to the company we have built over the last seven years, we are excited about the possibilities that lie ahead.</p>
            <p class="mt-4">In closing, we would like to thank all our customers, partners, and supporters who believed in our vision and supported us throughout this journey. We are proud of what we have accomplished over the last seven years, and we believe that the innovations we have developed will continue to make a positive impact in the SmartCity space.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-20 grid justify-items-stretch">
            <p class="justify-self-center w-3/4 sm:w-1/3 font-light text-xl text-gray-800 font-serif tracking-wide">With the kindest regards</p>
<p class="justify-self-center w-3/4 sm:w-1/2  font-light text-xl text-gray-600 mt-2 italic tracking-tight">Christian, Anders and the team that made the journey an experience of a lifetime.</p>
            <p class="justify-self-center mt-5 w-3/4 sm:w-1/3 font-light text-xs text-gray-500 sans">P.s. want to know what we're working on now? You can follow us here: <a target="_blank" class="font-bold hover:font-black hover:text-gray-900" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/christian-%C3%B8stergaard-laursen-527b8b29/" >Christian</a> and <a class="font-bold hover:font-black hover:text-gray-900" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anders-h%C3%B8edholt-041b8a29/">Anders</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden pt-16 lg:pt-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
        <img src={overviewImage.src} class="mb-[-12%] rounded-xl shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-gray-900/10" alt="">
        <div class="relative" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="absolute -inset-x-20 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white pt-[7%]"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
	</main>
</Layout>
